                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2780093,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Erosion is of course bad for people trying to grow crops or breed animals on that terrain.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 182.0,
                  "from": 175.92,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2780111,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "In the nineteen seventies and eighties, Lal was studying soils in Africa so devoid of organic matter that the ground had become extremely hard, like cement.",
                "meta": {
