                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 2780297,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This created carbon dioxide and released it into the air, and in some places, grazing by domesticated animals has removed all vegetation, releasing carbon into the air.",
